    {
      "_id": "dATOEzHyNWLeKxrA",
      "name": "Stalwart",
      "type": "class",
      "img": "icons/skills/trades/smithing-anvil-brown.webp",
      "system": {
        "category": "calling",
        "identifier": "calling-stalwart",
        "source": "Callings",
        "tags": [
          "calling",
          "stalwart",
          "body"
        ],
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><em>\"The Shattering didn't end the work. Nothing ends the work.\"</em></p><p><strong>Stalwart</strong> is the Body Calling — the trade that kept its bearers alive after the Shattering. Umbrella: laborer, teamster, forager, wall-crew, rig-hand, survivor. A profession is a flavor label on the Calling.</p><p><strong>Knack — Hazard-Hardened:</strong> Reduce each environmental hazard/radiation tick by 1 (by 2 at Tier III), and labor output counts double for facility/build work.</p><p><strong>Aptitude kit:</strong> signature aptitude <strong>Athletics</strong> rank = tier; secondary <strong>Plating</strong> rank = tier − 1.</p><p><strong>Services:</strong> a standard job costs the tier fee (T1 10 / T2 30 / T3 90 / T4 270 marks), paid in <strong>Economy</strong> marks. Cross-pool ×1.5 friction applies as usual.</p><p><strong>Tiers:</strong> Apprentice → Initiate → Master → Archon. Grant the matching tier features alongside this class item.</p><p><strong>Awakens into:</strong> Bulwark or Soul-Smith. A Steward is a Calling that ignited into a Path — Surge is the mark of Stewardship, which is why no Calling banks or spends it.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        }
      },
